<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1Wakolintu</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Wak</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Wakolintu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya mtumbulo lya Paulo kwa Wakolintu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya mtumbulo lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wakolintu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba lya mtumbulo lya mndumindumi Paulo kwa Wakolintu liyandikilwi kulichuva lya 55, badili gha kuwelekwa kwa Yesu Sula gha mtumbulo msitali wa mtumbulo. Hali ni lihamba lya mtumbulo paghati gha lihamba ivili Paulo awayandikilile lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lya haku Kolintu. Ayandikili lihamba hali pangi akiwela angulikala ku Efesu, pambila gha lihengu lyaki lya kutyangila haku Kolinto akiva mumwanja kuyenda haku akipitila Makidonia Sula gha ikumi na isita kutumbula musitali wa itano mbaka wa itisa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba hali liwelili ni kuyanga milando Paulo apokelili kuhuma kwa wandu waghangi wamkwinilile Kilisito kulongelela mighalu wekaweka mihakata igholekili paghati gha wandu wenikumkwinila Kilisito haku Kolintu, mighalu hai mihakata ni pamonga na mlekanilo na ungongola. Wandu wa kukolintu wamanyikanili kwaikiva gha ndyangilu ghao gha kupala nesu ngongola, kwa nagha iwela ng'ogha mghalu wa kukangasa kulola yiwa hata lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito na weni wagholile mighalu hai. Kulihamba hali kuvile na sula yeni kupalwa nesu yeni kulongelela habali gha Upalo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo anguwajambusa Wakolintu na kumsukwile Sapanga kwaikiva gha weni, msula gha mtumbulo kutumbula na msitali gha mtumbulo mbaka msitali wa itisa.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo angulongelela habali gha kulekanilana kwa wandu wenikumkwinila Kilisito haku Kolintu. Msula gha mtumbula msitali kutumbula na msitali wa ikumi mbaka sula gha njechi msitali wa ihisilini na imonga.</para>
  <para style="io">Hilahila Paulo angulongelela habali gha ungongola na habali gha kuyeghana weni kunjengakaya. Msula gha mhano na sula gha isita.</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi Paulo anguwapegha malaghilo kulongelela kuposa, kuyegha matambiku kuming’omung’omu na kukonganika kwaikiva gha kuyupa na hupo kuhuma kwa Mpumulo gha Sapanga na kuhinduka. Msula gha isaba mbaka kusula gha ikumi na mhano.</para>
  <para style="io">Kumwihu Paulo anguyomola kwa kulaghila mighalu yenikupalwa kugholeka ila na mighalu gha kila mundu mweni handa mweni. Msula gha ikumi na isita.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Nenga Paulo mweni kukemwa kuwela mndumindumi kwa mapalo gha Sapanga niweli mndumindumi wa Kilisito Yesu, lihamba hali niyandikila nenga na Sositenesi mlongo wa nenga.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Tunguwayandikila mwenga weni kuwela lipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito Yesu haku kumlima wa Kolintu mwenga mkemwa muweli wandu wa Sapanga kukukonganika na Kilisito Yesu, pamonga na wandu wogha wakumahala wekaweka weni kumkwinila Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito mwenikuwela Bambu wa mwenga na wa twenga hilahila.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Twenga tunguwayupila highili na kuponga kuhuma kwa Sapanga Tati wa twenga na Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo angumshukwile Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Nenga ningumshukwile Sapanga machuwa hyogha kwaikiva gha mwenga kwavila awagholilile mwenga ghamaha kwa kupitila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Kwa kukongana na Kilisito kawapegha kila kindu kila mngukipala na hinaa mvile na uwesa wa kulongela kila kindu akipalile na kumanya kila kindu angupala mkimanyi. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Mighalu hai ingulangiha ghala tulongelile kumlongelela Kilisito kwa mwenga ni chakaka, <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />kwa nagha mlepelelwa ng'ogha hupo yoyosi kuhuma kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga handa vila muwela mngulindila kwa luhujulu kuhuya kwa Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Sapanga atewaghola mgangamali mbaka mwihu, ili mkotoho kuwela na masitaka lichuwa lila atehuya Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Sapanga ateghola hagha kwaikiva mweni ni mchakaka. Mweni ndiwa kawakema mwenga mkongani na Mwana ghaki Yesu Kilisito Bambu wa twenga.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulekana mghati gha lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Walongu wa nenga, kuukulu wa lihina lya Yesu Kilisito pepahi ninguwaluwa, mjumilani kumighalu hyogha munguilongela ili pakotoho kuwela na mlekaniko paghati gha mwenga, nesunesu muweli na lukani limonga na liwachilo limonga. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Walongo ghangu, wandu waghangi wenikuwela kuukaya gha Kiloe wanilongela yiwa mwenga mvile na magombi. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Wandu hagha wanongela nenga nagha. Mundu mghangi angulonga yiwa nenga, “Ningumkovekela Paulo,” na ghangi, “Angulonga nenga ningumkovekela Apolo,” hilahila yungi angulonga, “Nenga ningumkovekela Petelo” yungi kangi kangulonga, “Nenga ningumkovekela Kilisito”. <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Ghuli, Kilisito kalekanika? Ghuli, Paulo ndiwa avambilwi mulipingika kwaikiva gha mwenga? Au ghuli, mbatisilwi handa wavulwa wa Paulo?<verse eid="1CO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Ningumshukwile Sapanga kwaikiva nenga nimbatisa ng'ogha mundu yoyosi paghati mwa mwenga ila Kilisito na Gayo weka yau. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Kwa nagha kwahela mundu yoyose paghati mwa mwenga anguwesa kulonga yiwa abatisilwi handa mvulwa wa nenga. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Yina, ngumbuka hilahila nimbatisili Sitefano na wandu wa kaya ghaki, kihyetu na hagha ngumbuka ng'ogha yiwa nibatisili mundu mghangi kangi. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Kwaikiva Kilisito kanilaghila ng'ogha nenga niwabatisi wandu ila niwatangasili wandu Habali Maha, na nigholi nagha ng'ogha kwa milando gha ukambenga ukambenga lukani makakala gha kihu kya Kilisito kulipingika ikotoho kuwela yaghi yaghi.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisito ni makakala na luhala lwa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Kwaikiva ujumbi wa kihu kya Kilisito kulipingika unguwoneka ni undyungi kwa wandu wenikuyaghamika, ila kwa twenga wenikuwela kunjila gha ulokola tungulola makakala gha Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Kwaikiva Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Niteyalamisa luhala lwa weni luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">na nitelema malangu gha weni kuwela na mavulo.” <verse eid="1CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Hinaa, wawela kugha wala weni luhala? Wawela kugha wavula wa laghililo, wawela kugha weni umanyi wa kungingamana milando haku kumlima wogha, Sapanga kaghola luhala kumlima wogha kuwoneka yiwa ni undyungi.<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Kwaikiva kuluhala lwa Sapanga wandu wanguwesa ng'ogha kummanya Sapanga kwa luhala lwau weni baha ila Sapanga kapala kuwalokola wala weni kukwinila kwa njila gha ujumbi hau tunguutangasa na hau ndiwa hula wala wandu weni luhala wanguulola yiwa ni undyungi. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Wayahudi wanguhakula vilangihi na Wayunani wanguhakula luhala ili wakwinili, <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />ila twenga tunguwatangasila mwenga Habali zya Kilisito yula mwenikuvambwa kulipingika. Habali yenikuwoneka inguwahoma moyu Wayahudi na undyungi kwa wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Ila kwa wala weni kukemwa na Sapanga, Wayahudi na wandu wawela ng'ogha Wayahudi, Kilisito ni makakala gha Sapanga na luhala lwa Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Kwaikiva kila kinguwoneka yiwa ni undyungi wa Sapanga kivile na luhala kupiti luhala lwa kimundu, na kila kinguwoneka ulepelelu wa Sapanga kivile na makakala kupiti makakala gha kimundu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Hinu walongo wa nenga mngumbuki pala Sapanga paawakemili. Kwa muwoneko wa kimundu watangala paghati gha mwenga muwonekanili handa muwela ng'ogha na luhala kuulongolo gha wandu, hilahila watangala paghati gha mwenga muwonekanili yiwa muwela ng'ogha na makakala kuulongolo gha wandu, kangi paghati gha mwenga muwonekanili yiwa weni kumanyikana nesu kuulongolo gha wandu. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Ila Sapanga akahaghula mighalu yeni kuwoneka kuulongolo gha wandu yiwa ni gha kindyungi, ili awatayi honi wandu weni luhala, kangi Sapanga kahaghula vindu vyeni ulepelelu kumlima wogha ili kuwataya honi wandu weni makakala. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Sapanga kahaghula vindu vyeni kupughanyika na wandu na kulemwa na vyeni kuwoneka yiwa vya maha ng'ogha, ili ayalamisi vila vinguwoneka na wandu yiwa vya maha kumawachilo gha kimundu. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Sapanga agholile nagha ili akotoho kuwoneka mundu wa kujiyinula kuulongolo ghaki. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Sapanga mwenibaha ndiwa awakonganisili mwenga na Kilisito Yesu. Na Sapanga kamghola Kilisito aweli luhala lwa twenga. Tunguwoneka yiwa wandu maha kuulongolo gha Sapanga na wandu weni kujumilwa na Sapanga na weni kukombolwa. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Hinu, handa iyandikwa ku Mayandiko gha Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:31">“Mweni kupala kujitutumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:31">na ajitutumule kwa kila akigholile Bambu.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Kumtangasa Kilisito avambilwi mulipingika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Walongo ghangu nenga panihikili kwa mwenga haku kumlima wa Kolinto kuwatangasila ujumbi wa Sapanga, nipalile ng'ogha kulangiha yiwa ningulongela kwa luhala. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Kwaikiva nilamulile paniwela kwa mwenga nilonge mighalu gha Yesu Kilisito weka yaki kangi kuhova kwaki kulipingika bila kulongelela kindu kighangi chochosi. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Lipindi paniwela kwa mwenga niwelili mlepelela na nihighimilile kwa holu. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Lipindi paniwelili nikivula na kutangasa niwela ng'ogha nikilonga milando ili mjumili luhala lwa nenga ila makakala gha Mpumulo wa Sapanga yawelili yakilangiha uchakaka. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Nigholile nagha ili ukwinila wa mwenga utegemeli makakala gha Sapanga na ng'ogha luhala lwa kimundu.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhala lwa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Ningutangasa ujumbi wa luhala kwa wala wenikuwela wakula kiukwinila, ila ng'ogha luhala lwa kumlima wogha, wala luhala lwa wala wakulu wa mlima wogha hau wenikuwela kulipinga lya weni kuwela na mwihu wa ulongosi ghao. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Ila twenga tunguvula luhala lwa Sapanga lula lweni kulifisa kwa wandu, lula luhala ahaghulile Sapanga kwaikiva ghamaha pambila gha kulumbwa kwa mlima wogha. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Kwahela hata kilongosi mmonga paghati gha vilongosi wa mlima wogha hau mweni kumanya luhala lwa Sapanga, handa wangalimanya wangalileka kumvamba Bambu wa kuyinulilwa mweni kulongosa kundumba na kumlima wogha. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Ila, handa iyandikwa kumayandiko gha Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Mighalu ivile mundu apatile ng'ogha kulola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">hilahila kuhyoghanila hagha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">mighalu ivile mundu kawesa ng'ogha kuiwachila kumoyu ghaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">hagha ndiwa Sapanga awayandalilile wala weni kumpala.” <verse eid="1CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Ila twenga Sapanga katulangiha mighalu hai kupitila Mpumulo ghaki kwaikiva Mpumulo ghaki angulola hyogha hata ghala yenikuwela Sapanga kayahigha. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Kwaikiva kwahela mundu mweni kuwesa kumanya mawachilo gha mundu ghangi ila ni mpumulo weka weni kulikala mghati mwaki mweni. Hilahila kwahela mweni kumanya mawachilo gha Sapanga ila ni Mpumulo wa Sapanga ghaki. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Hinu tupokela ng'ogha mpumulo wa mlima mighalu hyogha ila tumpokela Mpumulo kuhuma kwa Sapanga ili tumanyi zyogha atupeghili Sapanga.<verse eid="1CO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Kwa nagha tulonga ng'ogha milando kwa luhala tunguvulwa na wandu ila tungulonga milando inguvulwa na luhala lwa Sapanga. Twenga tungulongelela mighalu gha Mpumulo wa chakaka kwa wala weni kuwela na Mpumulo wa Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Ila mundu mweni kuwela kahela hayu Mpumulo wa Sapanga kawesa ng'ogha kupokela hagha mighalu yeni kuhuma kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga, kwaikiva ni mpughanyo kwa mweni, na mweni kawesa ng'ogha kuyamanya kwaikiva hagha yangumanyika hela kwa mtanga wa Mpumulo. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Hinu mundu mweni kulongoswa na Mpumulo hayu angumanya mighalu hyogha ila wandu weni kuwela ng'ogha na Mpumulo wanguwesa ng'ogha kummanya. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Handa Mayandiko gha Sapanga yailongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">“Ghani kanguwesa kumanya mawachilo gha Bambu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">Kwa hela mundu kanguwesa kumtanga Sapanga mawachilo”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">Ila twenga tuvile na mawachilo gha Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Watumikila wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Walongo wa nenga niwesili ng'ogha kulonga na mwenga handa wandu weni kulongoswa na Mpumulo. Ila nilongili na mwenga handa wandu wa weni kulongoswa na mighalu gha kumlima wogha kangi weni kuwela handa wana wang'enya kukumkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Niwavulili mavulo mayuyughu kumanyika handa vila nyongo angumpegha maweli mwana ghaki. Kwaikiva muwela ng'ogha na uweso wa kupokela mulyo mgangamalu na mmbila kuwesa kupokela mavulo yatimila gha ujumbi wa Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Kwaikiva mwenga mmbila mngulama handa vila wandu wa kumlima wogha vila wangulama. Mwenga mngulama mkiwela na wifu pamonga na magombi. Mighalu hai hyogha ingulangiha yiwa mwenga mmbila mwa wandu wa kumlima wogha hau na mngulama handa wandu wa mlima wogha vila wangupala. <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Mmonga wa mwenga paalongile, “Nenga ningumkovekela Paulo,” na mghangi, “Paatelonga nenga ningumkovekela Apolo,” ghuli, mghola ng'ogha handa wandu wa kumlima wogha vila wangughola?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Ghuli Apolo ni ghani? Na Paulo ni ghani? Twenga ni watumikila wa Sapanga weni kuwayeghela ukwinila. Na kila mmonga wa twenga angughola lihengu apeghilwi na Sapanga agholi. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Paniwalongela ujumbi wa Sapanga niwelili handa mundu mtenu mweni kukulila mbeyu na kuulongolo Apolo akahika kumwaghilila masi hila mbeyu, ila Sapanga ndiwa mweni kughola imeli na kukula. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Hinu hagha wogha wagholile lihengu lya yaghi yaghi. Ila Sapanga mweni kumelesa na kukula kwa mbeyu ndiwa kaghola kindu. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Yula mweni kukulila mbeyu angulandana hela na hayu wa kumwaghililila masi. Sapanga atemhipa kila mmonga kukovekelana na lihengu aligholile. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Kwaikiva twenga ni watumikila tungughola lihengu pamonga na Sapanga, mwenga ni litawa lya Sapanga, hilahila mwenga ni lighuta lya Sapanga.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Kwa ulungwana Sapanga anipeghili na nenga handa mchenga nikamanya lihengu lyangu, nenga nikachenga mghomba wa maha wenikuwela mundu mghangi anguwesa kuchenga kunani ghaki. Ila mundu yoyosi mweni kuchenga na ailolesi vila anguyenda kuchenga kunani ghaki. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Kwaikiva kwahela mundu mweni kuwesa kuchenga mghomba mghangi kupiti hula uvikwa kala, ingumaanisa mghomba hau ni Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Kunani gha kitamilo haki mundu anguwesa kuchengela kwa sahabu au kwa feza au kwa maganga gha mapesa ghatangala au kwa mibiki au kwa manyahi au kwa mahamba. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Umaha wa lihengu lya mundu yeyosi litewoneka na kuvikwa paluagha kulichuwa lila atehika Kilisito kuwalamula wandu. Kwaikiva kulichuwa hali lyoto litegubutula lihengu lya kila mmonga na lyoto hali liteyesa lihengu lya kila mundu na kulangiwa yiwa ni maha au ng'ogha. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Paikawela kindu achengili mundu kunani gha kitamilo haki kitelungula ng'ogha kwa lyoto hali mundu hayu atepokela hupo. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Ila paikawela kindu kila akichengili kunani gha haki kitamilo kitelungula, hinu, mundu hayu atepokela ng'ogha hupo ghaki, ila mwenibaha atelokolwa handa vila katyelembuka kuhuma kulyoto.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Ghuli, mmanya ng'ogha yiwa mwenga ni lighuta lya Sapanga na Mpumulo wa Sapanga angulikala mghati mwa mwenga? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Hinu handa mundu ateyalamisa lighuta lya Sapanga na hilahila Sapanga atemyalamisa mundu hayu. Mwenga handa lighuta lya Sapanga Kwaikiva mwenga ni hindu gha Sapanga.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Mkotoho kuingonga wenibaha. paikawela mundu yeyosi paghati gha mwenga akaliwachila yiwa kana luhala handa luhala lwa mlima wogha hau, ni mbaha aweli ndyungi ili apati luhala lwa chakaka. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Kwaikiva, luhala lwa kumlimawogha ni undyungi kuulongolo gha Sapanga. Kwaikiva iyandikwa kumayandiko gha Sapanga, “Sapanga anguwawomela wandu weni luhala lwa mlima wogha kuukambenga wa weni.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Hila hila Mayandiko yangulonga, “Bambu angumanya mawachilo gha wandu wa mlima wogha weni luhala, luhala lwau lwa yaghi yaghi”. <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Kwaikiva gha hagha, ungupalwa ng'ogha kuitutumulila kilongosi yeyosi. Vilongosi wogha wavikwa kuwatanga mwenga handa wandu wa Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Paiwela Paulo au Kefa au mlima wogha au ukomu au kihu au lipindi lya hinaa au lipindi lya kuulongolo vyogha ni vya mwenga, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />na mwenga ni wandu wa Kilisito, na mweni Kilisito ni wa Sapanga.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Wandumindumi wa Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Hinu, wandu na watuloli yiwa twenga twa watumikila wa Kilisito, na Sapanga katupegha lihengu kuwatangasila wandu ujumbi weni kuvikwa ng'ogha lipala kwa wandu. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Hinaa mundu mweni peghwa lihengu hali angupalwa aweli mtumikila mchakaka. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Ila kwa nenga ningutila ng'ogha panilamulwa na mwenga au njenga kaya, ila mweni baha niilamula ng'ogha. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Kwaikiva kumoyu nilamulwa ng'ogha na mghalu wowosi, ila hai ingulangiha ng'ogha yiwa nenga ngosela ng'ogha, Sapanga ndiwa mweni kunilamula. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Hinu mkotoho kumlamula mundu yoyosi pambila gha kuhika lipindi lyaki, mlindili mbaka paatehika Bambu. Mweni atelangiha kila kindu kijihigha mulwisa na kuvika lipala mawachilo yavile mumioyu gha wandu. Hinu kila mundu atesifilwa handa ingumpala asifilwe.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Walongo wa nenga, ningulongela mighalu hyogha hagha gha nenga na Apolo ili iweli mtanga kwa mwenga. Kwa mlandano wa nenga na Paulo ningupala mmanyi lukani lwa milando hai, “Mkamuli ghala yenikuyandikwa” Kukotoho kuwela hata mundu mmonga paghati mwa mwenga mweni kuidumbila mundu tenu na kumpughanya mundu ghangi. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Kwaikiva ni ghani kakughola wenga uwoneki mmaha kupiti wayaku? Ghuli ng'ogha Sapanga ndiwa mweni kukupegha vindu vyogha uvili navyu? Na ikiva mpeghwa hinu kwakyani mngulikwina handa vila mpeghwa ng'ogha?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Hinaa mpokela kala vyogha mnguvipala hinu muwela kala wanaisa. Muwela wankosi kangi bila twenga! Ni maha mngaliwela wankosi chakaka ili na twenga tuweli wankosi pamonga na mwenga. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Ila kwa twenga wandumindumi ningulola Sapanga katuvika kuwela wandu wa kupughanyika kupiti wogha, tuwela handa wandu weni kulamulwa kukomwa kuulongolo gha wandu tuwela kindu kya kiheku kuulongolo gha mlima wogha na kuulongolo gha watumikila wa kundumba na kuulongolo gha wandu. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Wandu watangala wangutulola twenga handa wandyungi kwaikiva gha kumtumikila Kilisito, ila mwenga mngujilola ni weni luhala kwaikiva mngumkovekela Kilisito! Twenga tunguwoneka handa tuwela ng'ogha na makakala, ila mwenga ndiwa weni makakala. Mwenga mngutundamilwa, ila twenga tungupughanywa. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Mbaka lisaa hali twenga tuvile na njala na kuyumilila na hilahila twahela nguu na kangi tungutovwa, na hilahila tuwela ng'ogha na ukaya, <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />kangi tungughola mahengu matopehu kwa mawoku gha twenga wenibaha, patulighwa, tunguwahighila, wandu pawatupokola twenga tungufumilila, hilahila na patuhakilwa twenga tungufumilila, <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />hilahila na lipindi pawangutukupikila twenga tunguwayanga maha. Mbaka hinaa tunguwoneka handa ndaka zya mlima wogha kangi twamaha ng'ogha kwa chochosi.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Ninguyandika ng'ogha hagha kwa lukani lwa kuwapughanyisa, ila ninguwavula handa wana ghangu niwapalile. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Hata handa mngaliwela na wavulwa watangala nesu kungalilu gha mwenga gha Kikilisito, ila muwela ng'ogha na watati watangala nenga niwelili tati wa mwenga kwa kuwayeghela Habali Maha. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Hinu ninguwaluwa pepai mgholi handa vila ningughola nenga. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Kwaikiva gha nagha ningumlaghila Timotheo kwa mwenga, mweni ni mwana ghangu mpalwa mwenikuwela ningumtumainila kulihengu lya Bambu. Mweni atewakumbusa njila ghangu hila ninguikovekela kukukongana na Kilisito. Njila gha kulama kula ninguvula kila mahala kumapinga gha wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Wandu ghangi paghati gha mwenga watumbula kala kulitutumula wakiliwachila yiwa nenga nitehika ng'ogha kangi kwa mwenga. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Ila Bambu paatepala nenga nitehika kwa mwenga kwa kuloposela. Hinu niteilolela mweni ng'ogha kila wanguwesa kulongela hagha weni kuitutumula, ila hilahila kila wanguwesa kukighola. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Kwaikiva Unkosi wa Sapanga uwela ng'ogha kumilando hela ila ghala wanguwesa kuyaghola kumakakala gha Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Mngupala kyani? Nihiki kwa mwenga na mhimbati, au nihiki na moyu wa upalo na unyalinyali?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Ungongola ni mhiko kulipinga lya Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Walongo kiuchakaka ingulongwa yiwa paghati mwa mwenga kuvile na ngongola na hai ngongola iwesa ng'ogha kuwoneka hata kwa wandu wamkwinila ng'ogha Kilisito. Nilongelwa yiwa mmonga paghati mwa mwenga anguwonja na mhumbu wa tati ghaki. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Mnguwesa ghuli kujitutumula? Ingaliwela maha kwa mwenga kumuwonela luhungu mundu hayu na mundu mweni kughola nagha abaghulwi paghati gha mwenga. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Pamonga na yiwa napamu ng'ogha na mwenga ila moyu ghangu upamonga na mwenga, hinu handa vila niwela baha haku nimlamula kala mundu hayu mweni kughola mghalu hau wa honi. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Pamngulikungula pamonga kulihina lya Bambu wa twenga Yesu, na nenga napamonga na mwenga kimpumulo haku, na makakala gha Bambu Yesu yanguwela bahala. <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />Mngupalwa mumyegheli Lihyukana mundu hayu ili mhigha ghaki uyalamiswi na mpumulo ghaki ulokolwi lichuwa lila lya kuhika kwaki Bambu Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Maha ng'ogha mwenga kujitutumula! Mwenga mmanya ng'ogha simika mayaghani inguwesa kututumusa ukowa wogha ugholwa na ngandilu? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Hinu mjighululi kwa kumuhumisa mundu hayu mhakata paghati gha mwenga na kughola nagha ni handa muhumisa simika gha dahile, kwa nagha mtewela wandu wahyonu handa ukowa mhyonu ukandilwi wenikuwela ng'ogha na simika na havi ndiwa ngalilu gha mwenga iwela. Kwaikiva Sapanga amgholile Kilisito aweli litambiku handa Mwanakondolu wa Pasaka ili atulokoli. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Hinu, tukotoho kuhina mhambu wa Pasaka kwa simika lya dahile ingumaanisa kwauhakata na sambi, ila tuhini kwa mibumunda ivikwa ng'ogha simika imaanisa kwa moyu mbuleti na uchakaka.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Niwayandikilile kulihamba lyangu yiwa mkotoho kukonganika na wandu weni kughola sambi gha ngongola. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Panilongile nagha nimaanisa ng'ogha yiwa mwenga mkotoho konganika na wandu wogha kumlima hau, kihyetu kyaki mngalipalwa muhuki kumlima wogha hau ili mlilekanisi na wala waghola ngongola, au weni lumatamata, au wapokola na wala weni kuyupa ling'omung'omu. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Ila niwayandikilile yiwa mkotoho kukonganika na mundu yeyosi mwenikulonga yiwa angumkwinila Kilisito handa mwenga, kunu akiwela mngongola, au mwimi, au mwenikuyupa ling'omung'omu, au mjongesela, au mlowela na mlulunganyi. Mundu wa nagha hata pakulyegha mkotoho kulyegha na mweni.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Kwaikiva ng'ogha lihengu lya nenga kuwalamula wandu wenikuwela ng'ogha kulipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito. Ila mwenga mngupalwa kuwalamula wandu wenikuwela kulipinga lya weni kumkwinila Kilisito Mayandiko yangulonga. <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Sapanga atewalamula wandu wenikuwela ng'ogha kulipinga lya Kilisito. Kwaikiva iyandikwa Kumayandiko gha Sapanga, “Mhumisi mhakata kulipinga.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Wamkwinila Kilisito wayomoli magombi wenibaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Paikawela na mundu yoyosi paghati mwa mwenga kana magombi na mkwinila myaki, kwa kyani amyeghi myaki kwa njengakaya gha wandu wakwinila ng'ogha? badili gha kumyegha kwa wandu weni kumkwinila Sapanga? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Ghuli mmanya ng'ogha yiwa wandu weni kumkwinila Sapanga watewalamula wandu wamlima wogha hau? Hinaa handa mwenga wenikumkwinila Sapanga mtelamula wandu wamlima wogha hau hinu kwa kyani mngusindwa kulamula mighalu misokombi sokombi? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Ghuli mmanya ng'ogha yiwa mtewalamula watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga? Handa ni nagha hinu mngupalwa kuyomola mighalu misokombi misokombi gha kila lelo. <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Pamuwela na mkologhanyu kungalilu gha kila lelo kwa kyani muwakemi wandu wenikuwela na ngalilu twenga tuijumila ng'ogha kulipinga lya tumkwinila Kilisito wagholi ndulumu? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Ningulonga nagha ili mloli honi. Ghuli kwahela hata mundu mmonga mweni luhala paghati gha mwenga mwenikuwesa kuwagholela ndulumu gha mighalu misokombi sokombi paghati gha mwenga weni kumkwinila Kilisito? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Badili ghaki mzyowela yula mweni kukwinila Kilisito kumyegha mkwinila myaki kuulongolo gha njengakaya na kuwaleka wandu weni kumkwinila ng'ogha Kilisito wamlamuli.<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Kichakaka kwa kitendu haki inguwonesa yiwa kwahela mundu mweni uweso wa kughola ndulumu. Ghuli kwakyani ingawela ng'ogha maha mwenga kugholelwa mahakata? Ghuli ingaliwela maha ng'ogha mwenga kupokolwa hindu? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Badili ghaki, mwenga ndiwa mngughola mahakata na kupokola, na kangi mnguwagholela hagha hata wakwinila wayenu. <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Ghuli mngumanya ng'ogha yiwa hagha wahakata wateyingila ng'ogha kuunkosi wa Sapanga? Mkotoho kuingonga weni ng'ogha wangongola hata weni kuyupa ming'omung'omu na wala weni kuwonjana walumi kwa walumi au wadala kwa wadala, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />hata waihi na hata weni lumatamata lihakata na hata walowela na hata walongelela wandu mahakata na hata wapokola na wandu hagha wogha wateyingila ng'ogha ku Unkosi wa Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Wamonga wa mwenga muwelili nagha, ila hinaa mlekeselwa mahakata, mkagholwa wandu wa Sapanga, na kugholwa wamaha kuulongolo ghaki na kukonganiswa na Sapanga kwa kupitila Bambu Yesu Kilisito na kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga wa twenga.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihigha gha mwenga na Mipumulo gha mwenga vimyinuli Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Mundu anguwesa kulonga nagha, “Nenga nilekeselwa kughola kindu chochosi.” Ila ng'ogha kila kindu kyeni umaha. Ningujumila yiwa ninguwesa kughola kila kindu ila nitelekesela ng'ogha kindu chochosi kinilongosi. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Unguwesa kulonga, “Mulyo ni kwaikiva gha mtima na mtima ni kwaikiva gha mulyo.” Mhigha wa mundu ulumbwa ng'ogha kwaikiva gha ngongola ila kwa kumtumikila Bambu, na hayu Bambu ndiwa mweni kugholokela mihigha. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Kwa makakala ghaki Sapanga amuhindulile Bambu na kangi atetuhindula na twenga kwa makakala ghaki.<verse eid="1CO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Ghuli mmanya ng'ogha yiwa mihigha gha mwenga ni vikongonu vya Kilisito? Ghuli nitoli vikongonu vya Kilisito nivikonganisi na mhigha wa mngongola? Ng'ogha nagha. <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Ghuli ingumaanisa ng'ogha yiwa mundu mweni kukongana na mngongola hayu kamhigha mmonga na mundu hayu? Kwaikiva Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga, “Hagha waivili watewela mhigha mmonga.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Ila yula mweni kukongana na Bambu anguwela na mpumulo mmonga na Bambu.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Hinu mlikali kutali na ngongola. Kwaikiva mundu pakaghola sambi angughola panji gha mhigha ghaki ila mundu pakaghola ngongola anguugholela sambi mhigha ghaki mweni. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Ghuli mmanya ng'ogha yiwa mihigha gha mwenga ni Lighuta lya Mpumulo wa Sapanga, mweni kuwela mghati mwa mwenga, yula mpeghilwi na Sapanga? Kwa nagha mwenga ng'ogha hindu gha mwenga baha ila mwenga ni hindu gha Sapanga, <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />kwaikiva mwenga muhemelilwi kwa mapesa ngenju. Kwa nagha mumyinuli Sapanga kupitila mihigha gha mwenga.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Paulo anguyanga milando ilongela ndowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Walongu hinaa niteyanga kila mnikonyili mulihamba lila mniyandikilili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:1">Mnikonyili, Ni maha mlumi akotoho kuposa? <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Ila kwaikiva gha kuwela kwa ngongola, kila mlumi angupalwa aweli na mhumbu ghaki mweni, hilahila kila mdala angupalwa aweli na mngwana ghaki mweni. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Mngwana angupalwa aweli angumgholela mhumbu ghaki handa ingupalwa amgholeli, hilahila mhumbu angupalwa aweli angumgholela mngwana ghaki handa ingupalwa amgholeli. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Mhumbu kahela uweso kunani gha mhigha ghaki bila mngwana ghaki, hilahila mngwana kahela uweso kunani gha mhigha ghaki bila mngwana ghaki. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Hinu mkotoho kuleka kupeghana, ila pamlaghana mkotoho kupeghana kwa lipindi mayaghani hela, ili muwesi kuwela na lipindi maha lya mayupu. Mgholi njenji kukongana kangi ili Lihyukana likotoho kuwayesa kwa mwenga kusindwa kufumilila.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Ningulonga nagha ng'ogha amuli ila munguwesa kuhaghula mwa weni. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Ningapala wandu wogha waweli handa nenga niwela, ila kila mmonga kana hupo ghaki kuhuma kwa Sapanga, mmonga hupo hai na ghangi hila.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Hinu wala wogha waposa ng'ogha na wala waposwa ng'ogha pamonga na wala wahumbu wahovitiliwi na wangwana ghao ninguwalongela ni maha wakayendelela kulikala handa nenga. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Ila handa ungusindwa kuikanisa mweni, unguwesa kuposa kwaikiva ni mbaha kuposa kupiti kuwela na lumatamata lwa mhigha.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Kwa wala waposanili kala ninguwapegha amuli hai, kangi ni gha nenga ng'ogha ila ni gha Bambu, “Mhumbu akotoho kumleka mngwana ghaki.” <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Ila handa kamleka, angupalwa ahighali bila kuposwa, au wapatani na kuhuyilana, hilahila mngwana kapalwa ng'ogha kumleka mdala ghaki.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Kwa hagha waghangi ningulonga nagha, hai ng'ogha amuli gha Bambu paikawela mngwana kana mhumbu kakwinila ng'ogha Kilisito ila hayu mdala kajumila kulikala na mweni nenga nonga akotoho kumleka. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Namweni mhumbu mkilisito kana mngwana na hayu mngwana kamkwinila ng'ogha Sapanga ila hayu mngwana akajumila kuyendelela nayu akotoho kumleka hayu mngwana. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Kwaikiva hayu mngwana au mhumbu mweni kummanya ng'ogha Sapanga angujumilwa na Sapanga kwa kupitila mhumbu ghaki, au mngwana ghaki, handa ingawela ng'ogha nagha hata wana ghao wangalijumilwa ng'ogha na Sapanga, ila hinaa wangujumilwa na Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Hata nagha, ikiva yula mweni kummanya ng'ogha Kilisito angupala kumleka myaki mweni kumkwinila Kilisito, hinu, na amleki. Kwaikiva hayu mlumi au mdala mweni kukwinila Kilisito kakaniswa ng'ogha. Pamonga na hagha hyogha Sapanga katukema kumlimawogha hau tulikali kwa kuponga. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Kwaikiva wenga mhumbu mkilisito unguwesa ghuli kumanya yiwa pangi unguwesa kumlokola mngwana ghako? Au wenga mngwana mkilisito unguwesa ghuli kumanya yiwa pangi utemlokola mhumbu ghako?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulikala handa kalaghila Bambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Kila mundu ayendeleli kulama ngalilu kukovekelana na hupo apeghilwi na Bambu, alami handa vila alamili lipindi paakemilwi na Sapanga milando hai ndiwa hilahila ninguwalongela mapinga gha wogha weni kumkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Handa mundu akemilwi na Sapanga akiva kayingiswa jandu, hinu akotoho kujighola yiwa kayingiswa ng'ogha jandu, na handa paakemilwi awelili kayingiswa jandu ng'ogha, hinu na akotoho kuyingiswa jandu. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Kwaikiva kuyingiswa jandu au kuleka kuyingiswa jandu kungumanisa ng'ogha kindu, ila kila kyeni kumaanisa kindu ni kukola malaghilo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Hinu kila mmonga wa mwenga na atami handa kawela paakemilwi na Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Ghuli, ukemilwi lipindi uwela mhusutu? mghalu hau ukotoho kukughasa. Ila pamonga na yiwa uvili na fwasi gha kuwela mundu pekesu, ila handa bambu ghako kakulekesela ukotoho kuwela mhusutu hinu uyendi zyaku. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Kwaikiva mundu yula mweni kukemwa na Bambu akiva mhusutu hayu mundu anguwela mundu pekesu kwa Bambu. Hilahila na yula mundu mweni kukemwa akiva mundu pekesu, ni mhusutu kwa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Mhemelwa na Sapanga kwa mahipo yatangala, ili mkotoho kuwela wahusutu wa wandu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Walongo ghangu, kungalilu gha mwenga hyonu pamonga na Sapanga kila mmonga wa mwenga angupalwa kuyendelela kulama kundambu kawela lipindi paakemilwi na Sapanga.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mavulo yenikulongela kuposa na kuhoviliwa na wangwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Hinaa nitewalongela kunani gha vila mnikonyili kulongelela wala waposwa ng'ogha na waposa ng'ogha, nenga nahela laghililo kuhuma kwa Bambu, ila hagha ni mawachilo ghangu na mwenga mnguwesa kunijumila kwaikiva Bambu kaniwonela luhungu.<verse eid="1CO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Kwaikiva gha maghasu matangala gha machuwa hagha, ninguliwachila yiwa ni maha mundu alikali handa kawela. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Ikiva uposa kala, ukotoho kuhakula kulekana na mhumbu ghako. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Ila pauposa, utewoneka ng'ogha na sambi, hilahila yula aposilwi ng'ogha pakaposwa atewoneka ng'ogha na sambi, ila wala weni kuposana watewela na maghaso kukulama na nenga ningalipala maghaso hagha yakotoho kuwahikila.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Walongo ghangu, ningumanisa yiwa lipindi lihighala ni lihupi. Hinaa muweli mngughola mahengu gha Bambu hinu wala weni kuposa waleki kuwawachilila wahumbu ghao weka ila wagholi mahengu gha Bambu. <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />Hilahila weni kulila waweli handa walila ng'ogha, na weni kuhekelela waweli handa weni kuhekelela ng'ogha, hilahila wala weni kuhemela waweli handa wavile ng'ogha na kindu, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />na wala weni kughayaghaya na hindu gha mlima wogha hau wawoneki handa weni kughayaghaya ng'ogha. Kwaikiva mlima wogha hau upabehi kuhika mwihu.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Ningalipala mwenga mkotoho kuwela na holu. Mundu mweni kuposa ng'ogha angughola mahengu gha Bambu, ingumaanisa anguhakula vila anguwesa kumhekelesa Bambu. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Ila mlumi aposili angughola mahengu gha mlima wogha, ili ahakuli vila atewesa kumhekelesa mhumbu ghaki, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />hilahila hayu angukweghwa kunjila ivili, na kangi mdala mweni kuposwa ng'ogha au msikana angughola mahengu gha Bambu. Ajighululi mhigha na mpumulo kwaikiva gha kumhekelesa Bambu. Ila yula mweni kuposwa angughola mahengu gha mlima wogha, ili apati kumhekelesa mngwana ghaki.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Milando hai ningulongela ni kwa fwaida gha mwenga, na ng'ogha kuwavikila mwenga ngingamu yoyosi, ila ningupala mgholi yala yangupalwa ili muwesi kumtumikila Bambu kwa moyu wogha.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Ikiva handa mundu yeyosi anguliwachila yiwa angumgholela ng'ogha biti amyeghelili lihamba kwa watati ghaki kwa kulindila kumposa na pakalola machuva yanguyenda na lumatamata ghaki lungumghola asindwi kuikanisa mweni hinu na amposi. Kwa kughola nagha atewela ng'ogha kaghola sambi. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Ila ikiva mlumi pakapala mweni bila kulasimiswa yiwa niteposa ng'ogha na paikawela atewela ng'ogha na lumatamata kwa wadala hayu angughola maha kuleka kumuposa hayu mdala amyeghilile lihamba kwa watati ghaki. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Hinu yula mweni kuposa angughola maha, ila yula mweni kulamula ng'ogha kuposa angughola maha nesu.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Mdala mweni kuposwa anguwela pahi gha malaghilo gha mlumi ghaki lipindi lyogha mngwana ghaki pakawela mkomu. Ila handa mngwana ghaki pakahova, mweni anguwela pekesu kuposwa na yula mweni kumpala, ila mngwana hayu aweli mweni kumkwinila Kikilisito. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Ila ni maha yula mwenikuhovilwa na mngwana ghaki ahighali bila kuposwa, hagha ni mawachilo gha nenga na nenga ningulonga nagha kwaikiva niwela na Mpumulo wa Sapanga.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Milyo yeni kuhumiswa litambiku kwa ling'omung'omu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Hinaa kwa habali gha milyo ihumisilwi litambiku kwa ling'omung'omu tungumanya yiwa twenga wogha tuvile na umanyi. Umanyi ungutughola tujidumbi twaweni ila upalo unguwaghola watangala wagangamali kuukwinila. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Mundu yoyose yula mweni kuliwachila yiwa angumanya kindu, kwa uchakaka hayu angumanya ng'ogha chochosi handa vila angupalwa kumanya. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Ila handa mundu angumpala Sapanga, hinu na Sapanga angummanya mundu hayu.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Hinu kwa habali gha milyo yeni kuhumiswa litambiku kwa ling'omung'omu tungumanya yiwa ming'omung'omu ng'ogha kindu kumlima wogha ila tungumanya Sapanga ni mmonga hela. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Pamonga na yiwa kuvile na vindu vitangala vivile wandu wanguvikema milungu iweli kumlima wogha au haku kunani, pamonga na yiwa kuvile na milungu na mabambu watangala, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />ila kwa twenga Sapanga ni mmonga hela avile ni Tati, ndiwa alumbili vyogha, na twenga tungulama kwaikiva gha mweni. Hilahila tuvili na Bambu mmonga hela avile ndiwa Yesu Kilisito kwa kupitila mweni hindu hyogha ilumbilwi na twenga tungulama kwa kupitila mweni.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Ila ng'ogha kwa wandu wogha weni kumanya uchakaka hau. Kwaikiva kuwela na wandu watangala weni kuzyowelela kuyupa ming'omung'omu wandu hagha mbaka hinaa pawalyegha milyo hai inguwaghola waliwachili ihumisilwa kwa ming'omung'omu hinu wanguilola wangughola sambi kwaikiva wakamala ng'ogha kuukwinila. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Mulyo uwesa ng'ogha kutuvika pabehi na Sapanga, hinu patuleka kulyegha tupungulwa ng'ogha chochosi na patulyegha kiyongeseka ng'ogha chochosi.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Ila muweli mihu na hau upekesu wa kulyegha mulyo wowosi, upekesu hau ukotoho kuwaghola wala weni kukamala ng'ogha kuukwinila wayingili kukughola sambi. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Kwaikiva mundu mweni kukamala ng'ogha kuukwinila pakakulola wenga mweni kumanya ungulyeghga kumighuta gha hai gha kuyupila ming'omung'omu, ghuli watekweghwa ng'ogha na weni kulyegha milyo ihumisilwi litambiku kwa ming'omung'omu? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Kwa njila hai, hayu mlongu mweni kukwinila kusokombi, ateyalamika kwaikiva gha umanyi ghako mlongo mwenikuwela Kilisito ahovili kwaikiva gha mweni. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Handa pamkaghola walongo wa mwenga wakoseli kwa njila hai na kuhakila mioyu ghao mtewela mumkosela Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Kwa nagha, paitewela kila nitelyegha kitemyambusa mlongu mweni kukwinila agholi sambi, nitelyegha ng'ogha katu, kwaikiva panitelyegha nitemghola myangu mweni kukwinila ayingili kusambi.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Mahengu gha Wandumindumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Ghuli, nenga na ng'ogha mundu pekesu? Ghuli, nenga na ng'ogha mndumindumi? Ghuli, nenga nimlola ng'ogha Yesu Bambu wa twenga? Ghuli mwenga mumkwinila ng'ogha Bambu kupitila lihengu lya nenga? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Pamonga na yiwa wandu waghangi wangunilola nenga yiwa mndumindumi ng'ogha, ila kwa mwenga nenga na mndumindumi kwaikiva kukwinila kwa mwenga kungulangiha yiwa nenga nilaghilwa na Bambu.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Havi ndiwa ningulitetela kwa wandu weni kunikonya. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Ghuli twenga tungupalwa ng'ogha kupokela mulyo au vinywegha kwaikiva gha lihengu tungulighola? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Ghuli, mnguliwachila twenga tusindwa kuwela na mwanja na wahumbu wa twenga weni kukwinila handa waigholile wandumindumi waghangi na walongo ghaki Bambu na Petelo? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Au ni nenga na Balinaba hela twenikulasimika kughola lihengu ili tuwese kupokela vindu vya kututanga vya kila lelo? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Ni mtovangondo ghani mweni kuyenda kungondo na kuihemelela mweni hindu? Ghuli ni mtukutula ghani mweni kutukutula misabibu na akotoho kulyegha matungula gha misabibu? Ghuli mhungaji ghani mweni kuhunga na kuleka kunywegha maweli gha lipinga lila angulihunga?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Milando hai ninguilonga ng'ogha milando gha wandu hela ila hata laghililo lya Musa ndiwa lingulongela. <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Kwaikiva iyandikwa kulaghililo lya Musa, “Ukotoho kumwopa ng'ombi mlomo paangunyukutula nganu.” Ghuli, Sapanga angulongelela habali zya ng'ombi? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Ghuli, paailongile milando hai atulongelili ng'ogha twenga? Chakaka yayandikilwi kwaikiva gha twenga, kwaikiva wogha waivili mtukutula na mbena wangupalwa wapokeli lihomosi kila mmonga. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Hilahila na twenga patutangasa ujumbi wa Sapanga kwa mwenga, ni handa kukulila mbeyu gha kimpumulo kwa mwenga, ghuli tungupalwa ng'ogha kupokela hindu kwaikiva gha ngalilu hai kuhuma kwa mwenga? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Handa mwenga mngujumila kuwapegha waghangi hindu gha kuwatanga kungalilu ghao, hata twenga mngupalwa kujumila kututanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Ila twenga tunguwaghasa ng'ogha mtuhipi hila hindu mngupalwa kutupegha ila tungufumilila kuhyogha lukani tukotoho kuwayambusa wandu wakotoho kukwinila Habali Maha gha Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Ghuli mwenga mngumanya ng'ogha yiwa wala watumikila wa kulighuta lya Sapanga wangupokela mulyo ghao kuhuma kulighuta lya Sapanga? Ghuli wala weni kutumikila kuluhanja wangupokela mbandi gha litambiku hali? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Hilahila, Bambu alaghilili yiwa wala wangutangasa Habali Maha wapati mtanga kuhuma kwa wala weni kupokela Habali Maha.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Ila nenga nitumila ng'ogha hata fwasi imonga paghati gha hazi fwasi. Wala niyandika ng'ogha ili iweli nagha kwa nenga, ni mbaha nenga nihovi kupiti kumghola mundu yoyosi aningingami nikotoho kujiyinula yiwa ninguitangasa Habali Maha bila mahipo. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Handa ninguwatangasila wandu Habali Maha mghalu hau ng'ogha wa kuisifila, ila hali ni lihengu lya nenga nipeghilwi na Bambu niligholi, chondi nenga handa nitewatangasila ng'ogha wandu Habali Maha. <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Handa ningalihaghula lihengu hali mweni hinu ningalindila mahipo, ila hinaa ningupalwa kughola kwaikiva Sapanga ndiwa mweni kunipegha lihengu hali niligholi. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Kupitila hali nenga ninguhipwa liki? Mahipo gha nenga ni kuwatangasila wandu Habali Maha bila kuhipwa, nikileka kuluwa kindu chochosi kila kingunipala nipokeli kwaikiva gha kughola lihengu lya kutangasa Habali Maha.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Hata nagha nenga namhusutu ng'ogha wa mundu yoyose, ila nijigholile kuwela mhusutu wa kila mundu, ili niwese kuwayegha watangala nesu kwa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Paniwelili nikighola lihengu na Wayahudi niwelili handa Myahudi, ili niwapati Wayahudi kumkwinila Kilisito. Pamonga na nenga mweni ningulongoswa ng'ogha na laghililo lya Sapanga ampeghili Musa, ila niwelili handa niwela nikilongoswa na laghililo, lukani niwapati weni kulongoswa na laghililo lya Sapanga ampeghili Musa. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Paniwela nikighola lihengu na wandu wawela ng'ogha na laghililo niwelili nikilama handa weni ili niwatangi wawesi kumkwinila Kilisito. Panilonga nagha ng'ogha yiwa nenga niyitikila ng'ogha laghililo kuulongolo gha Sapanga, chakaka nenga ningulongoswa na laghililo lya Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Hila hila paniwela nikilama na wandu wagangamala ng'ogha kukummanya Sapanga, nikalikala handa mundu nigangamala ng'ogha kukummanya Sapanga ili niwapati wandu weni kugangamala ng'ogha. Nigholile kila njila kwa wandu wogha ili wawesi kulokolwa amonga gha weni.<verse eid="1CO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Ningughola hagha hyogha kwaikiva gha Habali Maha, ili niwese kupokela na waghangi highili zyaki. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Ghuli, mmanya ng'ogha yiwa wala wenikutula mbilu wangutula wogha ila mwenikulongoha ndiwa mwenikupokela hupo? Mtuwi mbilu handa nagha ili mpati hupo. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Kila mundu mweni kuliugha kumghalu wa kutuwa mbilo anguilemesa mighalu mitangala, na angughola nagha ili apokeli hupo yeni kuyalamika, ila twenga tungughola nagha ili tupokeli hupo yeni kuyalamika ng'ogha. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Hata nenga ningutula nesu ili nisindi. Ndiwa ningutovana, ili nikotoho kuwela handa mundu mweni kutovana yaghiyaghi, <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />ila naughola mhigha ghangu ili uwesi kufumilila, ningughola nagha lukani paniyomola kuwatangasila wandu waghangi nikotoho kulemwa.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Paulo anguwakanisa wakotoho kuyupila ming'omung'omu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Pamonga na hyogha, walongu wa nenga ningupala mngumbuki yiwa watati wa twenga wogha wala walongosilwi na Musa wawelili pahi gha lihindu wakigholokelwa, na wogha wahubhukili maha kubahali gha Shamu. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Pawalongosilwi na lihindu na kuphiti paghati gha bahali, wogha wakawela wabatiswa kuwela watumikila wa Musa. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Wogha walyeghili mulyo hula hula weni kuhuma kwa Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />Hilahila wogha wakanywegha kinywegha kimonga kya kimpumulo kihumile kwa Sapanga, kwaikiva wanyweghili masi yahumili kumghomba, na mghomba hula awelili ni Kilisito mweni. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Ila wandu watangala kulipinga lyau wamhekelesili ng'ogha Sapanga, hinu wakahova na mihigha ghao ikalandala kuluvagha.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Hinu mighalu hai hyogha ni mlandano kwa twenga ili kutukanisa twenga tukotoho kuwela wandu weni kuwela na lumatamata lwa kughola mighalu mihakata handa weni vila wagholile. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Mkotoho kuyupila mang'omung'omu, handa wamonga ghao vila wawela, handa yailonga mayandiko, “Wandu watamili pahi wakalyegha na kunywegha, hinu wakayimuka na kuhina kwa honi.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Hinu twenga tukotoho kughola ngongola handa waghangi vila waigholile, kwaikiva kwa lichuwa hali limonga mbaka wakahova wandu ielufu ihisilini na itatu. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Hinu tukotoho kumyesa Bambu, handa wamonga ghao vila wamyesili, wakahova kwa kulumwa na wanjoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Mukotoho kung'ung'ulika handa wamonga ghao wagholili, wakomilwi na mtumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga mkoma wandu.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Mighalu hai hyogha iwakolile weni ili twenga tuivuli, hagha yayandikwa ili kutuvula twenga tweni kulikala kumachuwa gha kumwihu.<verse eid="1CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Kwa nagha mundu mweni kuliwachila yiwa kagholoka maha kuukwinila hinu alihungi ili akotoho kuguwa. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Mayeso hagha mnguyapokela ni ghala ghala yeni kuwakola wandu waghangi. Sapanga kamchakaka, na mweni atewaleka ng'ogha myeswi kupiti uwesa wa mwenga. Ila pamyeswa mweni atewapegha makakala gha kufumilila na njila gha kuhukila.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Kwa nagha walongo ghangu wapalwa, muleki kuyupa mang'omung'omu. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Ningulonga na mwenga wandu weni malangu, mliwachili hagha ninguwalongela. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Kila kikombi kya highili kila tungukihighila, tungukongine na mwahi gha Kilisito. Patulyegha libumunda tungukongana na mhigha gha Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Kwaikiva libumunda ni limonga, Pamonga na yiwa twenga twa watangala, twa higha immonga, kwaikiva wogha tungupeghana libumunda hali limonga.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Hinaa mloli kila wangughola wandu wa mlima wa Kuizilaeli, wenikulyegha litambiku kuluhanja, wangukongana kukumpegha litambiku Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Hinu nilongi kyani? Yiwa mulyo wenikutambikilwa ling'omung'omu ni kindu kupiti mulyo? Na hagha mang'omung'omu, ghuli, ni kindu chakaka kupiti ming'omung'omu? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Ng'ogha, ila kila ningupala kulonga ni yiwa, mitambiku gha wandu wenikummanya ng'ogha Sapanga wanguwapegha mahoka na ng'ogha kwa Sapanga. Nenga nipala ng'ogha mwenga mgholi pamonga na mahoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Mngupalwa ng'ogha kunyweghela kikombi kya Bambu kunu mngunyweghela kikombi kya mahoka. Mngupalwa ng'ogha kulyegha mulyo gha Bambu na kunu mungulyegha mulyo gha mahoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Ghuli, tungupala kumghola Bambu aweli na lilaka? Ghuli, twenga tuwela na makakala kupiti mweni?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Wandu waghangi paghati gha mwenga wangulonga vindu vyogha vilekeselwa ila ng'ogha vyogha vingutanga ila nenga ningulonga pamonga na yiwa vindu vyogha vilekeselwa ng'ogha vyogha vyeni kuwesa kuwatanga. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Mundu yoyose akotoho kulihakulila fwaida mwenibaha, ila awahakulile fwaida na waghangi.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Mlyeghi chochose kinguhuswa kusoku, mkotoho kukonya lilando lolose kwaikiva gha lukani lwa mioyu gha mwenga. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Kwaikiva Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga, “Mlima wogha na vyogha vivile mghati ni hindu gha Bambu.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Handa ukiyeghelwa mulyo na mundu mweni kumkwinila ng'ogha Kilisito na wenga ukiyitikila kuyenda kulyegha, ukalyeghi chochosi akukemilili ukileka kukonya kwaikiva gha lukani lwa moyu ghako. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Ila handa mundu yoyose akikulongela, “Mulyo hau ugholelwa litambiku lya mang'omung'omu,” hinu ukotoho kulyegha ili mundu yula mweni kuwalongela akotoho kughasika mumoyu na mwenga hilahila mkotoho kughasika. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Ningulonga hagha, kwaikiva gha maghaso gha kumawachilo, na ng'ogha maghaso kwa mwenga ila yula mweni kuwalongela,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Pangi mtenikonya, “Kwa kyani mawachilo gha mundu mghangi yalamuli nenga kya kughola, nenga napekesu kughola kila ningukipala.” <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Ningumshukwile Sapanga pambila gha kulyegha mulyo ghangu, handa ningughola nagha kwa hela mundu yeyosi kanguwesa kulonga ni maha ng'ogha nenga kulyegha hau.<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Hinu, lolose mgholile, handa ni kulyegha au kunywegha, mgholi hyogha kwa kumyinula Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Mukotoho kughola mghalo wowosi utewaghola wandu waghangi kughola mahakata, kwa Wayahudi au Wayahudi ng'ogha au kwa lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Sapanga, <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />muweli handa nenga, ningupala kuwahekelesa wandu wogha kumighalu hyogha ninguighola. Kwaikiva ninguhakula ng'ogha fwaida kwaikiva gha nenga mwenibaha ila ninguwahakulila wandu fwaida ili walokolwi.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Mnikovikeli nenga handa vila nenga nimkovikela Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugubika mutu lipindi lya kuyupa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Ninguwasifila kwaikiva mwenga mngunikumbwiki kumighalu hyogha na hilahila mngukola ghala niwapeghili. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Ila ningupala mmanyi yiwa kilongosi wa kila mlumi ni Kilisito, na kilongosi wa mdala ni mlumi, na kilongosi wa Kilisito ni Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Hinu, kila mlumi mweni kuyupa au kutangasa Habali Maha gha Sapanga kunu kagubika mutu ghaki, hayu angumpughanisa Kilisito mweni kuwela kilongosi ghaki. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Ila mdala paanguyupa au kutangasa ujumbi wa Sapanga akiva kahela kigubiko kumutu ghaki, hayu angumpughanya mlumi ghaki, na mdala mweni kughola nagha kangulandana na mdala mweni kumoa hwila ghaki. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Ikiva mdala kagubika ng'ogha mutu ghaki, ni mbaha amoi hwila ghaki. Ila kwa vila ni honi kwa mdala kumoa hwila ghaki, ni mbaha agubiki mutu ghaki. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Mlumi angupalwa ng'ogha kugubika mutu, kwaikiva mweni ni mlandano wa Sapanga na ukulu wa Sapanga. Ila mdala angulangiha angumtundamila mlumi ghaki. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Kwaikiva mlumi kalumbwa ng'ogha kuhuma kwa mdala, ila mdala kalumbwa kuhuma kwa mlumi. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Hilahila Sapanga kamlumba ng'ogha mlumi kwaikiva gha mdala, ila Sapanga kamlumba mdala kwaikiva gha mlumi. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Ndiwa kwaikiva mdala angugubika mutu ghaki, ili kulangiha yiwa kangulongoswa na mlumi ghaki, na hilahila kwaikiva gha watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Hata nagha, kukukongana na Bambu mdala bila mlumi kakindu ng'ogha na mlumi bila mdala kakindu ng'ogha kwaikiva kila mmonga angumtegemela myaki. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Kwaikiva mdala alumbilwi kuhuma kwa mlumi, hilahila mlumi kangulelwa na mdala. Ila vindu vyogha vinguhuma kwa Sapanga.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Mulamuli mwenga wenibaha, ghuli ni maheli mdala kagubika ng'ogha mutu paangumyupa Sapanga? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Hata kulumbwa kwa twenga kungulangiha yiwa ni honi kwa mlumi kuwela na hwila ndali. <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Ila mdala pakawela na hwila ndali ni mghalu gha utundamilu kwa mweni. Kwaikiva mdala apeghilwi hwila ndali ili kumgubika. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Handa mundu atekanila mghalu hau, kwa twenga hata kulipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito, twahela ndyangilu gha kusindanila hali.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulyo wa kumkumbwiki Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Matayu 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maliku 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Vila ninguyendelela kuwalaghila hinaa ningulaghila hagha, pamngukonganika mngughola mighalu mihakata kupiti mighalu ghamaha. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Kwa kutumbula pamkongana pamonga handa lipinga lyeni kumkwinila Kilisito kunguhumila mikologhanyu, na nenga kughala niyayoghanila ningujumila yiwa ni chakaka. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Kiuchakaka ni lasima magombi yahumili paghati gha mwenga ili wala wenikujumilika na Sapanga wamanyikani lipala lipala. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Hinu mwenga wakwinila pamngukonganika, mnguliwachila yiwa mngulyegha mulyo kwaikiva gha kukumbwiki lichuwa lya Bambu ila ng'ogha, <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Kwaikiva pamngulyegha, kila mmonga angughola kwa uloposelo kulyegha mulyo ghaki mwenibaha bila kuwapegha waghangi, na kuwaghola waghangi wahighali na njala na waghangi wakilowela. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Ghuli mwenga mvile ng'ogha na mighuta gha kulyeghela na kunyweghela? Au ghuli mnguwapughanya wandu weni kumpughanya Kilisito na kuwataya honi hagha wawela ng'ogha na kindu? Ghuli, niwasifili kuhali? Ng'ogha ninguwasifila ng'ogha kwaikiva gha mghalu hau.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Kwaikiva nenga yala mavulo nipokelili kuhuma kwa Bambu ndiwa niwapeghili mwenga, uhiku hula pambila gha Bambu Yesu kukamulwa, atolili libumunda, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />akamshukwile Sapanga, akametula libumunda, hinu akalonga, “Hau ndiwa mhigha wa nenga kwa ajili gha mwenga, mgholi nagha kwa kunikumbwiki nenga.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Hila hila, badili gha kulyegha, akatola kikombi kya divai, hinu akalonga, “Haki ni kikombi kya lilaghano lya hyonu linguhighiliswa kwa mwahi gha nenga, mgholi nagha kila pamnywegha, kwa kunikumbwiki nenga.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Kwaikiva kila pamngulyegha libumunda hali na kukinyweghela kikombi haki, mngutangasa kihu kya Bambu, mbaka paahika kangi. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Hinu, kila yula mweni kulyegha libumunda hali au kunyweghela kikombi haki kya Bambu vila ipalwa ng'ogha atewela kana sambi kwaikiva atewela kapughanya higha na mwahi gha Bambu. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Hinu, kila mundu ajilolesi mweni, hinu alyeghi libumunda na kunywegha divai gha kikombi haki. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Kwaikiva mundu yoyose mweni kulyegha na kunywegha bila kumanya mhigha wa Bambu ungumaanisa niki mundu hayu angujilamula mweni. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Ndiwa kwaikiva wandu watangala paghati gha mwenga ni wavina na walepelela na wandu watangala paghati gha mwenga wahova kala. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Ila tuilolesi maha twenga twaweni ili tukotoho kulamulwa na Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Ila patulamulwa na kunyokolwa na Bambu angutuvula utundamilu ili tukotoho tukalamulwa pamonga na wandu wa mlima wogha.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Kwa nagha, walongo ghangu, pamkonganika pamonga kulyegha mulyo kwaikiva gha kukumbwiki kihu kya Bambu, mlindilani na mkemani. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Handa mundu akiva na njala, alyeghi ukaya kwaki ili pamkonganika pamonga mkotoho mkalamulwa na Sapanga. Hai mighalu mighangi nitewavula panitehika.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Hupo kuhuma kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Hinu walongo ghangu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:1">ningupala mmanyi maha habali gha hupo zila zinguhuma kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Mngumanya yiwa pamuwelili mummanya ng'ogha Sapanga, muwelili mkikweghwa na kulongoswa kuyupa ming'omung'omu yeni kuwesa ng'ogha kulongela. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Kwa nagha ningupala mmanyi yiwa kwahela mundu angulongoswa na Mpumulo wa Sapanga akalonga, “Yesu na alapilwe.” Hilahila kwahela mundu mweni kuwesa kulonga, “Yesu ni Bambu,” pakalongoswa ng'ogha na Mpumulo wa Sapanga.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Hinu, kuvile na hupo wekaweka ila Mpumulo mweni kuwapatila wandu hupo hazi kammonga hela. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Hilahila kuvile na utumikila wa wekaweka ila Bambu mwenikutumikilwa kammonga hela. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Kuvile na uwesa wekaweka wa kughola mahengu, ila Sapanga kammonga mweni kuwawesesa wandu kutimilisa. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Mpumulo wa Sapanga angumtanga kila mundu kughola lihengu lyaki ili kuwatanga waghangi. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Mpumulo wa Sapanga angumpegha mundu mmonga uweso wa lilando lya luhala na ghangi uweso wa lilando lya malangu vila angupala. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Mpumulo wa Sapanga yulayula angumpegha mmonga ukwinila na angumpegha ghangi hupo gha kulamisa wandu, <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Mpumulo wa Sapanga hayu hayu angupegha mmonga uweso wa kughola ukangaso, ghangi uweso wa kulonga ujumbi wa Sapanga, na waghangi kumanya yiwa hupo hai inguhuma kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga au ng'ogha, waghangi kulongela luga gha kihenja, na ghangi hupo gha kughalambula hazi luga gha kihenja. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Ila yulayula Mpumulo wa Sapanga mmonga angughola mighalu hai hyogha, akimpegha kila mmonga hupo wekaweka handa apalili Mpumulo wa Sapanga.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhigha mmonga na vikongonu vitangala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Handa vila mhigha uvile mmonga na weni uvile na vikongonu vitangala, na vikongonu havi pamonga na yiwa viwela vitangala vinguuchenga mhigha mmonga na ndiwa inguwela kwa Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Kwaikiva twenga wogha tubatisilwi kwa Mpumulo mmonga ili tupati kuwela na mhigha mmonga, handa ni Wayahudi au Wandu wavile ng'ogha Wayahudi, handa ni wahusutu au wandu pekesu, natwenga wogha tupeghilwi Mpumulo mmonga.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Hinu mhigha unguchengwa ng'ogha kwa kikongonu kimonga hela ila unguchengwa kwa vikongonu vitangala. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Handa lighulu litelonga, “Nenga ng'ogha liwoku kwa nagha nenga ng'ogha wa mhigha,” ghuli, lighulu ng'ogha mbandi gha mhigha kwaikiva gha nagha? <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Na hilahila lipulukilo palitelonga, “Nenga ng'ogha lisu kwa nagha ng'ogha wa mhigha,” ghuli lipulukilo ng'ogha mbandi gha mhigha kwaikiva gha nagha? <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Handa mhigha wogha ungawela lisu, kuhyoghanila kungawela kugha? Au handa mhigha wogha ungawela pulikilo, mundu angaliwesa ghuli kumanya yiwa haki kingunugha? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Ila Sapanga kavika vikongonu havi vyogha kumhigha wa kila mmonga handa aipalile Sapanga mweni. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Handa vyogha vingawela kikongonu kimonga, mhigha ungawela kugha? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Uchakaka ni yiwa, mbandi zya mhigha zitangala, ila mhigha ni mmonga.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Lisu linguwesa ng'ogha kulilongela liwoku nenga “Ningukupala ng'ogha,” wala mutu unguwesa ng'ogha kulilongela lighulu nenga “Ningukupala ng'ogha.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Ila badili ghaki, vila vikongonu vya mhigha vyenikuwoneka vilepelelwa, ndiwa vyenikuwela vingupalwa nesu. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Kangi vikongonu vyeni kuwoneka yiwa vyeni kupughanyika ndiwa tunguvitundamila nesu, na vikongonu vya mhigha vila tunguvilola ni vya honi ndiwa tunguvigubika nesu, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />lipindi vila vikongonu vyeni kuyegha ng'ogha honi vingupala ng'ogha kugubikwa handa vikongonu vighangi. Sapanga mweni kavika maha vikongonu kumhigha, vikongonu vyeni kupughanyika kavighola vitundamilwi. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Kwa nagha kukotoho kuwela na mlekaniko, ila vikongonu vyogha vitangani. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Handa kikongonu kimonga pakinguvina, vikongonu vighangi vinguvina pamonga na kyeni, handa kikongonu kimonga kikapokela utundamilu, vikongonu vyogha vinguhekelela pamonga na kyeni.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Hinaa mwenga wogha ni mhigha wa Kilisito na kila mmonga wa mwenga ni kikongonu kya mhigha hau. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Kulipinga lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito mtumbulo Sapanga awavikili hagha wandumindumi, wakakovekela walota, nakangi wakakovekela wavula, hinu akavika wala weni hupo zya kughola makangaso, na kulamisa na kutanga, vilongosi na weni kulonga luga zya kihenja. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Wandu wogha ng'ogha wandumindumi, wandu wogha ng'ogha walota, wandu wogha ng'ogha wavula, wandu wogha ng'ogha weni kughola makangaso. <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Wogha ndiwa weni hupo zya kulamisa wavina, wogha ndiwa weni kulonga kwa luga zya kihenja, wogha ni weni kughalambula luga. <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Hinu myangalai kuhakula kupokela hupo zila ngulu nesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Ila hinaa nitewalangiha njila gha chakaka nesu kupiti zyogha.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Upalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Ninguwesa kuwela na uweso wa kulonga luga zya wandu na zya watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga, ila paniwela ng'ogha na upalo, ningughola hela lilowi handa lidebi lyeni kuwela ng'ogha na kindu au kengeli gha kushuli. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Kangi, ninguwesa kuvile na hupo gha kuyughanila na kutangasa ujumbi wa Sapanga, na kumanya kifisu kyogha kuhuma kwa Sapanga na kumanya kila kindu, hata ningaliwela na ukwinila wa kuwesa kuhumisa mitumbi, ila panikawela na nahela upalo nenga nakindu ng'ogha. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Hilahila nikatola hindu ghangu hyogha na kuwapegha wakapuku, hilahila pamonga na yiwa nikatola mhigha ghangu ulunguli kulyoto, ila panikawela nahela upalo nitewesa ng'ogha kupokela fwaida yeyosi.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Mundu mweni upalo anguwela na ufumilifu na anguwatanga waghangi na kahela wifu na kaitutumula ng'ogha na kanguwela ng'ogha na kinyengu. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Mundu mweni upalo kanguwatundamila wandu waghangi na kanguhakula ng'ogha fwaida kwaikiva gha mwenibaha na kanguyoma ng'ogha kwa kuloposela na kahela ngumbungumbu gha mahakata. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Mundu mweni upalo Kanguhyomela uhakata, ila kanguhekelelela uchakaka. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Mundu mweni upalo kangutenyuka ng'ogha moyu na machuwa hyogha kangukwinila na machuwa hyogha kanguwela na litumaini na hayu angufumilila mighalu hyogha.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Mundu mweni upalo anguyendelela kulangiha upalo machuwa hyogha. Ila hupo zighangi zivile na mwihu ghaki handa vila kuhyoghanila na kutangasa ujumbi wa Sapanga, havi vitehuka lichuwa limonga, na paikawela hupo gha kulonga luga gha kihenja, hai iteyomoka; na handa pakawela na malangu hagha na yeni yateyomoka. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Kwaikiva kuivula kwa twenga na kumanya mighalu ni mayaghani, hilahila kutangasa kwa twenga ujumbi kuhuma kwa Sapanga tungutangasa mayaghani hela ghala tunguyamanya. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Ila kutimila pakutehika mighalu hyogha itimila ng'ogha itehumiswa.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Lipindi niwelili mwanachali nilongili handa mwana, nimanyili handa mwana, niwachilili handa mwana. Ila hinaa, nenga niwela mundu mkulunga, mighalu hila gha uwana niileka. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Kila tungukilola hinaa ni handa kujilola kulisinila lihyonu lyeni kung'anyima, ila haku kuulongolo tutelola kwa umaha nesu. Hinaa ningumanya hela kwa mayaghani ila haku kuulongolo nitemanya kwa kutimila handa Sapanga vila angunimanya nenga kwa kutimila.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Hinu hinaa mighalu miitatu ndiwa itelama machuwa hyogha bila mwihu: ukwinila na litumaini na upalo; ila mghalu mkulu kupiti hyogha ni upalo.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Hupo ghangi zya Mpumulo wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Myangalai kuwela na upalo na kupala nesu hupo zya mpumulo, nesu nesu hupo gha kuwatangasila wandu ujumbi wa Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Kwaikiva mundu yoyosi mweni kulongela luga gha kihenja, kangulonga ng'ogha na wandu ila angulonga na Sapanga. Kwaikiva kwahela mundu yoyose angummanya, mundu hayu angulongela kwa makakala gha Mpumulo wa Sapanga kumighalu yeni kifisu. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Ila mundu hayu angutangasa ujumbi kuhuma kwa Sapanga, angulongela na wandu milando gha kuwagangamalisa ukwinila na kuwataya moyu na kuwapegha kiheku pawawela na lung'ai. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Mwenikulonga kwa luga gha kihenja angujichenga mwenibaha, ila yula mweni kulongela ujumbi kuhuma kwa Sapanga angulichenga konganiko lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Ningapala kila mmonga wa mwenga alonge kwa luga gha kihenja, ila ningapala nesunesu wogha mtangasi ujumbi kuhuma kwa Sapanga. Kwaikiva mweni kulonga ujumbi kuhuma kwa Sapanga angughola maha kupiti yula mweni kulongela luga gha kihenja, ili lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lyogha lipati kuchengwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Hinaa walongo wa nenga, handa nikihika kwa mwenga na kulongela na mwenga kwa luga gha kihenja, ghuli itewatanga niki? Itewatanga ng'ogha chochosi ila panitewalongela ghala Sapanga kanigubutulila na panikawapegha umanyi pamonga na kuwavula lilando lya Sapanga hai nitewela niwatanga.<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Hata vindu viwela ng'ogha na ukomu vivili na lilowi lyaki, hindu handa, mluli au sese. Mundu anguwesa ghuli kuumanya uyimbo handa vyombu havi vinguhumisa ng'ogha lilowi lya uyimbo hula wa kuhinwa? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Kangi handa lipembi lihumisa ng'ogha lilowi lyeni kumanyika ng'ogha, ni mtovangondu ghani ateliyandala kuyenda kungondu? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Hilahila na mwenga, handa mkilonga milando imanyika ng'ogha, mundu atemanyaghuli kumanya kila mkilongile? Kwaikiva mtewela handa wandu wenikulongela na liyegha. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Chakaka kuwela na luga zitangala haku umlima wogha, na zyeni luga zyogha zingumaanisa kindu. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Hinu handa nitewesa ng'ogha kumanya kila akilongela mundu kupitila luga ghaki nitewela mhenja kwa mundu hayu na mweni atewela mhenja kwa nenga. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Hilahila na mwenga. Kwaikiva mngupala kupokela hupo kuhuma kwa Mpumulo wa Sapanga, myangalayi nesu mpati hupo zyeni kuwatanga wandu kuchengwa ukwinila.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Kwaikiva gha nagha, mundu mweni kulongela kwa luga gha kihenja na ayupi ili awesi kuwaghalambulila wandu kila angukilongela kwa luga gha kihenja. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Kwaikiva, paniyupa kwa luga gha kihenja mpumulo gha nenga ndiwa anguyupa, ila malangu ghangu yangutumikana ng'ogha lipindi hali. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Ghuli Nigholi ghuli hinu? Niteyupa kwa mpumulo ghangu na niteyupa kwa malangu ghangu na vilavila niteyimba kwa mpumulo ghangu na niteyimba kwa malangu ghangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Msifili Sapanga kumpumulo weka, paikawela kuvili na mundu mghangi mwenikumanya ng'ogha kila ungukilongela ghuli, atewesa ghuli kulongela “hina”, na kwa kumshukwile Sapanga ikiva kamanya ng'ogha kila ungukilongela? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Unguwesa kumshukwile Sapanga kuuchakaka ila itemtanga ng'ogha mundu mghangi kumchenga kuukwinila.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Ningumshukwile Sapanga yiwa nenga ningulongela kwa luga gha kihenja kupiti mwenga wogha. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Ila paniwela paghati gha lipinga lyeni kumkwinila Kilisito nimbaha nilongeli milando miitano au minjechi ili nipati kuwavula waghangi kupiti nilongeli milando itangala nesu kwa njila gha kulongela kwa luga gha kihenja.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Walongo ghangu, mkotoho kuliwachila handa wana wang'enya, ila kuhabali gha uhakata muweli handa wana wanung'una. Pamuliwachila muweli handa wandu wakomi. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Kumayandiko gha Sapanga iyandikilwi yiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">“Bambu angulonga, nitelonga na wandu hagha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">kwa milando gha kihenja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">na nitelongela na wandu hagha kwa milomu gha kihenja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">ila wateniyoghanila ng'ogha.” <verse eid="1CO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Hinu kulonga kwa luga gha kihenja ni kilangihi kwa wandu wenikukwinila ng'ogha na ng'ogha kwa wandu wenikukwinila. Ila kulongela ujumbi wa kuhumila kwa Sapanga ni kwaikiva gha wandu weni kukwinila na ng'ogha kwa wandu wenikukwinila ng'ogha.<verse eid="1CO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Hinu paikawela lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito lyogha likakongananika kuyupa na kila mmonga akalonga kwa luga gha kihenja, na kuulongolo wakayingila wahenja wakwinila ng'ogha, ghuli, watelonga ng'ogha yiwa wogha muwela na lukwali? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Ila, wogha pawawela wakiutangasa ujumbi wa Sapanga, hinu akahika mundu mweni kukwinila ng'ogha, hyogha ateyahyoghanila kuhuma kwa wogha yatemghola amanyi uhakata ghaki, kangi yatemghola mundu hayu aghalambuki na kuleka sambi. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Mighalu gha kifisu kumoy ghakik itemanyika na atetova manung'una na kumyupa Sapanga akilonga, “Chakaka Sapanga kamonga na mwenga mahala haku.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumyupa Sapanga kwa vila ingupalwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Ghuli, walongo ghangu tulongi kyani? Pamngukongana pamonga kumyupa Sapanga, mmonga anguyimba uyimbo, na mghangi anguvula na mghangi angughola hupo gha kughalambula ujumbi wa Sapanga na mghangi angulonga luga gha kihenja na mghangi angughalambula ghala yangulongelwa kwa luga gha kihenja. Hyogha yangupalwa yaweli yeni lukani lwa kuchenga lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Handa mundu yoyose pakalonga luga gha kihenja, hinu walonge wandu waivili au waitatu na ng'onga kupiti hagha, mmonga badili gha ghangi na lasima paweli na mundu wa kughalambula hai milando yeni kulongelwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Ila handa paikawela kwahela mundu mweni kughalambula, hinu mundu hayu mwenikulongela lilando lya kihenja na alikali jii kulipindi lya wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito, na alongi na nafusi ghaki mweni na Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Wandu wenikulongela ujumbi kuhuma kwa Sapanga pawawela waitatu hinu na walongi mmonga mmonga. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Ila haku mkonganila pakawela na mundu mmonga angulongela na mghangi paghati gha wala weni kuhyoghanila kapokela ugubutulo kuhuma kwa Sapanga, hinu yula mweni kulongela na atami nuu. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Kwaikiva wogha mnguwesa kulongela mmonga badili gha ghangi ujumbi mpeghilwi na Sapanga ili mpati kuivula na kutaywa moyu. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Hupo gha kulongela ujumbi kuhuma kwa Sapanga ingupalwa kuwela pahi gha ulongosi wa yula apeghilwi hupo hai. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Kwaikiva Sapanga ng'ogha Sapanga wa magombi Sapanga wa kulikala kwa kuponga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Handa vila iwela kulipinga lyogha lya wandu wenikumkwinila Kilisito vila wawela wandu wa Sapanga, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />wadala wangupalwa kutama nuu kumapinga gha wandu wamkwinila Kilisito pawakonganika. lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito. Wapalwa ng'ogha kulonga, ila wangupalwa wayitikili handa Sapanga vila angulongela kulaghililo lya ghaki. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Handa wangupala kukonya wakawakonyi wangwana ghao kuukaya, kwaikiva ni honi kwa mdala kulonga mulipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Ghuli, lilando lya Sapanga lihumili kwa mwenga weka yenu? Au liwahikilile mwenga hela? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Handa mundu pakaliwachila yiwa kana hupo gha kulongela ujumbi kuhuma kwa Sapanga au kana Mpumulo gha Sapanga, amanyi yiwa hagha ninguwayandikila mwenga ni laghililo kuhuma kwa Bambu. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Ila handa mundu pakapughanya mghalu hau na mweni apughanyiswi.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Kwa nagha walongo ghangu, mngupalwa kuwela na luhujulu nesu lwa kutangasa ujumbi wa Sapanga, ila mkotoho kumkanisa mundu kulonga kwa luga gha kihenja. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Ila kila kindu kigholeki kwa umaha na kwa vila ingupalwa kuwela.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Kuhinduka kwa Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Hinaa, walongo ghangu, ningupala kuwakumbusa kulongelela Habali Maha hila niwatangasilile, hai muipokelili iwelili mghomba wa ukwinila wa mwenga. Na mwenga mngugangamalika kumghomba hau. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Ujumbi niwatangasilile ni Habali Maha, mwenga mtelokolwa pamkikola maha ghala niwatangasilile, handa paikawela nagha ukwinila wa mwenga wayaghi yaghi.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Nenga niwavulile mwenga mighalu gha maha nesu ivile nenga niipokelili: yiwa Kilisito ahovili kwaikiva gha sambi zya twenga handa mayandiko gha Sapanga vila yailongile, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />na akavikwa kulimambi na lichuwa lya itatu akahinduka handa mayandiko gha Sapanga vila yangulonga, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />mtumbulo Yesu akamuhumila Petelo na kuulongolo kwa lihanja lya ivili akawahumila wala wandumindumi ikumi na ivili. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Kuulongolo akawahumila wakwinila wayetu wenikuwela kupiti imia itano kwa pamonga, na waghangi ghao wakomu na waghangi wahova kala. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Kuulongolo akamuhumila Yakobu na hinu akawahumila wandumindumi wogha.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Mwihu wa wogha, akanihumila nenga kangi, nikawela handa mwana mweni kuwelekwa kulipindi lyaki ng'ogha. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Kwaikiva nenga ndiwa msokombi kupiti wandumindumi wogha, nipalwa ng'ogha kukemwa mndumindumi, kwaikiva nilihakilili lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito wenikuwela wandu wa Sapanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Ila kwa umaha wa Sapanga hinaa niwela mndumindumi, na highili anipeghili kambegha ng'ogha yaghi yaghi. Ng'ogha handa nigholile lihengu lya kutangasa kupiti wandumindumi waghangi wogha, ng'ogha nenga ila ni highili zya Sapanga zyenikuwela pamonga na nenga. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Hinu, nenga ndiwa nitangasili au wala wandumindumi waghangi, hali ndiwa tungulitangasa na mghalu hau ndiwa mnguukwinila.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhinduka kwa twenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Hinu handa tungutangasa yiwa Kilisito ahindukili, kwa kyani wamonga wa mwenga mngulonga kwahela uhinduko? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Ila handa kwahela uhinduko, hinu hata Kilisito ahindukile ng'ogha. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Kangi ikiva Kilisito kahinduka ng'ogha, kutangasa kwa twenga kwa yaghi yaghi na kukwinila kwa mwenga ni yaghi yaghi. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Kupiti hagha hyogha, twenga tungaliwoneka yiwa wahwangi kunani gha habali gha Sapanga, kwaikiva tuwalongilile yiwa Sapanga amuhindulile Kilisito, ila kamuhindula ng'ogha, paikawela ni chakaka hinu weni kuhova watehinduka ng'ogha. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Kwaikiva handa wahovili watehindulwa ng'ogha, hinu hata Kilisito mweni ahindukile ng'ogha. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Kangi handa Kilisito kahinduka ng'ogha, ukwinila wa mwenga ni yaghi yaghi, na mwenga mnguyendelela kuwela na sambi zyenu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Hinu, wogha wala wahovili wakiwela wangumkwinila Kilisito wayalamika. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Ikiva litumaini lya twenga mghati gha Kilisito ni kwaikiva gha ukomu hau hau, twenga tungupalwa tuwonelwi luhungu kupiti wandu wogha kumlima wogha.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Ila kwa chakaka Kilisito ahindukile, mweni ni wamtumbulo na kilangihi kya chakaka kwa wala wahovili yiwa watehindulwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Kwaikiva handa vila kihu kiyeghilwi na mundu mmonga, hilahila na kuhinduka kuyeghwa na mundu hayu mmonga kumlima wogha. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Handa vila wandu wogha wanguhova kwaikiva wahumila na Adamu hilahila wandu wogha wangugholwa wakomu kwaikiva gha kukongana na Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Ila kila mmonga atehinduka kwa kukovekela njila hai, Kilisito ahindukile mtumbulo na kuulongolo ghaki wala wenikuhova kunu wakimkwinila Kilisito watehindulwa pala paatehika Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Hinu mwihu utehika lipindi Kilisito paatempegha Sapanga Tati unkosi, paateyaghamisa kila ulongosi na uweso na makakala. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Kwaikiva Kilisito atelongosa mbaka lipindi awasindi wahakata ghaki na kuwalongosa. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Mhakata wa mwihu kuyalamiswa ni kihu. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Kwaikiva Mayandiko yangulonga nagha, “Sapanga kavika vyogha pahi gha ulongosi ghaki Kilisito.” Ila Mayandiko payalongile, “Vindu vyogha vivikwa pahi gha ulongosi ghaki Kilisito,” ingulangiha lipala lipala yiwa Sapanga kawela ng'ogha pahi gha Kilisito, kwaikiva mweni ndiwa mweni kuvika vindu vyogha pahi gha ulongosi gha Kilisito. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Ila vindu vyogha pavitevikwa pahi gha ulongosi wa Mwana ghaki, ndiwa namweni Mwana atejivika mweni pahi gha ulongosi wa Sapanga, ili Sapanga alongosi vindu vyogha na kila mahala.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Hinu handa kwahela uhinduko, ghuli, wategholaghuli wala wabatiswa kwaikiva gha wandu wahovili? Handa wahovili watehindulwa ng'ogha kwa kyani wandu wangubatiswa kwaikiva gha weni? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Na kumbandi gha twenga kwa kyani tungujiyambusila kuhova kila lelo? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Walongo gha nenga kila lelo nenga ninguliyambusila kihu! Chakaka ningulonga! Ningujisifila kwaikiva gha mwenga kukongine na Yesu Kilisito Bambu wa twenga. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Handa litumaini lya nenga lingaliwela lya mlima wogha hau, hinu kutovana kwa nenga na wandu wenikuiwela wakalipa handa mikokolu kumlima wa Efesu, ghuli kutenitanga niki? Handa wandu wahovile watehindulwa ng'ogha hinu hinaa, “Tulyeghi na kunywegha kwaikiva kilau tutehova.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Mukotoho kungongwa na wandu weni kulonga nagha kwaikiva, “Maghanja wahakata wanguyalamisa ndyangilu ghamaha.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Hinu mkalamuki walongo, mtumbuli kulama maha, na mleki kughola sambi. Kwaikiva amonga gha mwenga wammanya ng'ogha Sapanga katu. Hai ninguwalongela, ni honi ngulu kwa mwenga.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhigha gha uhinduko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Ila mundu anguwesa kukonya, “Ghuli wandu wahovili wanguwesa ghuli kuhindulwa? Ghuli watewela na mhigha wa ghuli?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Ukotoho kuwela mndyungi wenga kila ukikulila kiwesa ng'ogha kumela mbaka kihovi huti. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Paukulila ungukulila mbeyu imonga hela, ikiva mbeyu gha nganu au mbeyu ighangi na ng'ogha mmela handa mmela wenikuhumila kuulongolo. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Ila Sapanga kalumba mbeyu handa inguwoneka, na kila mbeyu ivile na muwoneko ghaki.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Hilahila viumbi wakomi na weni wawela na mihigha ghao na ingulandine ng'ogha. Wandu wavile na mihigha ghao na mikokolo ivile na mihigha ghao, wambongu wavili na mihigha ghao na homba hilahila wavili na mihigha ghao.<verse eid="1CO 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Kangi kuvile na mihigha gha kundumba na mihigha gha kumlima wogha, ila umaheli gha mihigha gha kundumba ingulandine ng'ogha na mihigha gha kumlima wogha. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Lijuwa livile na umaheli ghaki na mwehi uvile na umaheli ghaki, na ndondwa zivile na umaheli ghaki. Pamonga na yiwa ndondwa na zyeni zilekana umaheli ghaki.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Ndiwa itewela lipindi lya kuhindulwa wandu wahovili. Handa uwela mlandanu wa mbeyu, mhigha na weni ungusikwa na kuwola ila unguhinduka ukiva mkomu. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Mhigha ungusikwa kumuwoneku wa kupughanywa na kuwela ng'ogha na makakala ila unguhinduka kumuwoneku wa utundamilu na makakala. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Mhigha pausikwa, ungusikwa na mhigha hula wa kimundu, ila pauhindulwa unguwela mhigha wa kimpumulo, handa kuvile na mhigha gha kimundu hinu hilahila kuvile na mhigha wa kimpumulo hilahila. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Iyandikwa ku Mayandiko, “Mundu wa mtumbulo avile ni Adamu awelili kilumbi mweni mkomu,” ila Adamu wa mwihu ni mpumulo mweni kuwapegha wandu ukomu. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Ila ng'ogha hula mhigha wa kimpumulo weni kulongola, ila ni mhigha wa kimundu na kumwihu ni hula mhigha wa kimpumulo. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Mundu wa mtumbulo Adamu, alumbilwi kuhuma kulutupi ila mundu wa ivili ahumili kundumba. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Wandu wogha kumlima wogha wavile na mihigha handa Adamu ila wala wavile wa kundumba wawela handa yula ahumile kundumba. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Handa vila tulandanile na mundu mweni kulumbwa kuhuma kulutupi, ingumanisa Adamu, hilahila tutelandana na mundu ahumile kundumba, ingumanisa Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Walongo ghangu kila ningukilonga ni haki, kiloa kigholilwe kwa mhigha na mwahi vinguwesa unguwesa ng'ogha kuyingila kuunkosi wa Sapanga, wala mhigha wa kuyalamika unguwesa ng'ogha kuyingila kumahala inguyingila mihigha yeni kuyalamika ng'ogha.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Myoghanile, ninguwalongela kifisu, tutehova ng'ogha wogha ila tuteghalambulwa, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />mighalu itehumila bwitu handa kufumbata na kufumbula mihu lipindi lya lipembi lya kumwihu palitetovwa, kwaikiva lipembi litetovwa na wandu wahovili watehindulwa ili wakotoho kuhova kangi na weni wateghalambulwa mihigha ghao. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Kwaikiva mhigha hau wa kuyalamika ungupalwa ughalambulwi na kuwela mhigha uyalamika ng'ogha, na mhigha wa kuhova ungupalwa ughalambulwi na kuwela mhigha uhova ng'ogha. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Kwa nagha, mhigha hau wa kuyalamika pauteghalambulwa na kuwela mhigha uyalamika ng'ogha, na mhigha wa kuhova pauteghalambulwa na kuwela mhigha gha kuhova ng'ogha, hinu lila lilando liyandikilwi litetimila, “Kihu kiyalamiswa, usindi utimila.”<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Ghuli, wenga kihu usindi ghako wa kugha?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Ghuli, wenga kihu makakala ghako yenikuyegha utungu gha kugha?” <verse eid="1CO 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Sambi inguyegha utungu wa kihu na makakala gha sambi yanguwoneka kupitila laghililo lya Sapanga ampeghili Musa. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Ila tungumshukwile Sapanga angutupegha usindi kwa kupitila Bambu wa twenga Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Kwa nagha, walongo ghangu wapalwa, mgholoki kwa ugangamalo kuukwinila, machuwa hyogha muyendeleli kulihumisa kulihengu lya Bambu kwaikiva mngumanya yiwa mahengu mnguyaghola kwaikiva gha Bambu mngughasika ng'ogha yaghi yaghi.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Mapegho yanguwatanga wakwinila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Hinu ningulonga nagha mapesa kwaikiva gha kuwatanga wandu wa Sapanga. Mgholi kila niwalaghilile kughola kwa wandu weni kumkwinila wamkwinila Kilisito haku kumlima wa Galatia. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Kila ijumapili mundu atoli mapesa yayeghwi kukovekelana na vila mpokela ili panitehika nikotoho kukungula mapegho kangi. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Kwa nagha panitehika kwa mwenga, wala wandu mtewahaghula paghati gha mwenga nitewalaghila na lihamba lya kuwamanyisa wayeghi na mapegho gha mwenga haku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Handa itewoneka ni maha na nenga kuyenda na mwenga, hinu, tuteyenda pamonga.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukasini lwa Paulo kuyenda ku Makidonia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Nitehika haku kwa mwenga panipita kala ku Makidonia kwaikiva ningupalwa kuyenda ku Makidonia. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Ninguliwachila pangi ninguwesa kulikala na mwenga kwa machuwa mayaghani au nitelikala na mwenga lipindi lyogha lya lupepo lukani muwesi kunitanga kuyendelela na mwanja ghangu kokosi niteyenda. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Ningupala ng'ogha kulolana na mwenga na kuyenda hela. Ningutumaini nitelikala na mwenga kwa lipindi litali Bambu paatepala.<verse eid="1CO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Ila nitehighala bahala ku Efesu mbaka lichuwa lya mhambu wa Pentekosite, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />kwaikiva Bambu kanipegha fwasi maha gha kughola lihengu likulunga baha, pamonga na yiwa haku Efesu kuvile na wandu watangala wenikunikanila.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Timoseo pakahika kwa mwenga mumpokeli maha ili akotoho kuwela na holu kwaikiva mweni angughola lihengu lya Bambu handa nenga. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Hinu mundu yeyosi akotoho kumpughanya, ila mumtangi ayendeleli na mwanja kwa kuponga ili ahiki kwa nenga. Kwaikiva nenga ningumlindila nikiwela pamonga na wakwinila wayetu.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Hinaa ningulonga nagha kulongelela mlongo gha twenga Apolo, nimluwili nesu ahiki kwa mwenga pamonga na walongo waghangi. Ila mweni kangupala ng'ogha kuhika haku hinaa ila atehika haku paatepata fwasi.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milando gha kuyomolelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Mlikali mihu, mgholoki kwa kugangamala kuukwinila wa mwenga, muweli mgangamala na weni makakala. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Mighalu gha mwenga hyogha na igholeki kwa upalo.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Hinaa walongo wa nenga mngummanya Sitefano na wandu wa kukaya ghaki weni ni wandu wa mtumbulo kumkwinila Kilisito kumbwani wa Akaya na weni wajihumisa kuwatanga wandu weni kumkwinila Kilisito hinu ninguwaluwa nesu, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />hinu muwayitikili nesu wandu handa weni na waghangi wogha weni kughola lihengu hali pamonga na weni.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Ninguhekelela nesu pawahikile Sitefano na Fotunato pamonga na Akaiko, kwaikiva weni wanitangili kughola mahengu ghala nilepelelilwi kwaikiva mwenga muwelili ng'ogha haku niwela. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Weni wahekelesili moyu ghangu handa vila wahekelesili mioyu gha mwenga, wandu handa hagha ni maha kuwakumbwiki.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Malipinga gha wandu wenikumkwinila Kilisito haku Asia yanguwajambusa. Akila na Pilisila, pamonga na lipinga lyogha lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito liwelili ukaya kwa weni wanguwajambusa ku lihina lya Bambu. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Walongo wogha wenikuwela haku niwela wanguwajambusa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Wanguwajambusa kwa kulangiha upalo wa Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Nenga Paulo ninguwajambusa, mweni kuyandikila kwa liwoku lyangu mweni baha.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Mundu yeyosi mwenikumpala ng'ogha Bambu na alapilwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:22">Malanasa ingumaanisa Bambu wa twenga uhiki.<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Ninguwayupila Bambu watwenga Yesu awapeghi umaha ghaki.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Ninguwapala mwenga wogha wenikumkwinila Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>